dummy-x11 (1.0-3) unstable; urgency=low

  * libxcb.so.1 replaced with a logging wrapper that delegates to the real
    libxcb via dlopen/dlysm. Logs all xcb_* calls to
    /tmp/dummy-x11-libxcb.log (override: $YABROWSER_XCB_LOG).
  * Real libxcb installed at hidden path for delegation.
  * dummy-x11-report updated: libxcb treated as stub, not real.
  * README.md updated with logging details.

